# Project

> Template. Copy to `PROJECT.md` and fill it in; `PROJECT.md` is gitignored.

## Projects

One pack serves every project in `config/pack.json`. `PACK_PROJECT` selects one;
unset, `default_project` applies, and `arch.py env` prints which resolved.

| Project | Tree | Docs | Architecture | Scratch |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `<name>` (default) | `<source root>` | `<docs root>` | `architecture/<name>` | `tmp/<name>` |

- Say whether the projects share one checkout and branch, or live in separate ones.
- Say which files are shared, and which project must never edit them.
- Say which projects are scaffolded and which are declared but still empty.

